{"step_index":136,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:40:31Z","thinking":"**Updating the Website**\n\nI've just added a stunning Wikimedia image of Hundru Falls to the `index.html` file as the hero image. It's looking really good.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\" />\n  \n  <title>Discover Jharkhand | Famous Destinations & Tourist Expedition</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the authentic famous destinations of Jharkhand — Hundru Falls, Patratu Valley, Baidyanath Dham, Betla National Park, Parasnath Hill and collect your Explorer Passport stamps.\" />\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#061A13\" />\n\n  <!-- Google Fonts: Playfair Display (Editorial Serif) & Plus Jakarta Sans (Clean Modern Sans) -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n\n  <!-- Leaflet CSS for Dark Interactive Map -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\" integrity=\"sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=\" crossorigin=\"\" />\n\n  <!-- Custom Stylesheets -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/main.css\" />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/map.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Top Scroll Reading Progress Indicator -->\n  <div id=\"scroll-progress-indicator\" class=\"scroll-progress-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Fullscreen Particle Confetti Canvas -->\n  <canvas id=\"unlock-confetti-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================================================\n       PRELOADER / BRAND LOADING SCREEN\n       ========================================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"preloader\" class=\"preloader\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"preloader-content\">\n      <div class=\"preloader-symbol\">J</div>\n      <h1 class=\"preloader-logo\">JHARKHAND</h1>\n      <p class=\"preloader-tagline\">Explore • Discover • Unlock</p>\n      <div class=\"preloader-bar\">\n        <div class=\"preloader-progress\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Desktop Custom Cursor Follower for Destination Cards -->\n  <div id=\"card-cursor-follower\" class=\"card-cursor-follower\" aria-hidden=\"true\">EXPLORE</div>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================================================\n       STICKY NAVIGATION BAR\n       ========================================================================== -->\n  <header>\n    <nav id=\"navbar\" class=\"navbar\" aria-label=\"Main Navigation\">\n      <div class=\"container nav-container\">\n        <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"brand-logo\" aria-label=\"Jharkhand Tourism Home\">\n          <div class=\"brand-symbol\">J</div>\n          <span class=\"brand-text\">Jharkhand<span>.</span></span>\n        </a>\n\n        <!-- Desktop Navigation Links -->\n        <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n          <li><a href=\"#hero\" class=\"nav-link active\">Home</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"nav-link\">Famous Places</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"nav-link\">Interactive Map</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#travel-themes\" class=\"nav-link\">Experiences</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#about-footer\" class=\"nav-link\">About</a></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <!-- Navigation Actions -->\n        <div class=\"nav-actions\">\n          <!-- MAD FEATURE: Tourist Explorer Passport Trigger -->\n          <button id=\"passport-btn\" class=\"passport-nav-btn\" onclick=\"openPassportModal()\" title=\"View Your Unlocked Stamps & Explorer Rank\" aria-label=\"Explorer Passport\">\n            <span>🎒 Passport</span>\n            <span id=\"passport-count-badge\" class=\"passport-badge-count\">0/12</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <!-- Primary CTA Button -->\n          <a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"btn-primary\">\n            <span>Explore Now</span>\n            <svg class=\"btn-arrow\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n              <polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline>\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Mobile Hamburger Toggle -->\n          <button id=\"mobile-nav-toggle\" class=\"mobile-nav-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Mobile Menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-drawer\">\n            <span></span>\n            <span></span>\n            <span></span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Mobile Drawer Menu -->\n    <div id=\"mobile-drawer\" class=\"mobile-drawer\" aria-label=\"Mobile Navigation Drawer\">\n      <ul class=\"mobile-drawer-links\">\n        <li><a href=\"#hero\" class=\"mobile-drawer-link\">Home</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"mobile-drawer-link\">Famous Destinations</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"mobile-drawer-link\">Interactive Map</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#travel-themes\" class=\"mobile-drawer-link\">Curated Stories</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#about-footer\" class=\"mobile-drawer-link\">About Jharkhand</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;\">\n        <button class=\"passport-nav-btn\" style=\"justify-content: center; width: 100%;\" onclick=\"closeMobileDrawer(); openPassportModal();\">\n          <span>🎒 View Explorer Passport</span>\n        </button>\n        <a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"justify-content: center; width: 100%;\">\n          <span>Explore Destinations</span>\n          <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n            <polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline>\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <!-- ==========================================================================\n         HERO SECTION (CINEMATIC FULLSCREEN WITH AUTHENTIC HUNDRU FALLS PHOTO)\n         ========================================================================== -->\n    <section id=\"hero\" class=\"hero\" aria-label=\"Hero Introduction\">\n      <!-- Ambient Glowing Orbs -->\n      <div class=\"hero-orb hero-orb-1\"></div>\n      <div class=\"hero-orb hero-orb-2\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-bg-container\">\n        <img \n          src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Hundru_Falls%2C_Jharkhand%2C_India_4.jpg/1280px-Hundru_Falls%2C_Jharkhand%2C_India_4.jpg\" \n          alt=\"Majestic authentic view of Hundru Falls in Ranchi, Jharkhand\" \n          class=\"hero-bg-image\"\n          fetchpriority=\"high\"\n        />\n        <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-content\">\n        <span class=\"hero-tag\">Welcome to the Land of Forests</span>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"hero-title\">\n          DISCOVER <span>JHARKHAND</span>\n        </h1>\n        \n        <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Where Nature Tells A Story</p>\n        \n        <p class=\"hero-description\">\n          Explore authentic waterfalls, primeval Sal forests, sacred mountain summits, and iconic wonders carved across a 2.5-billion-year-old plateau.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-buttons\">\n          <a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"btn-primary\">\n            <span>Explore Destinations</span>\n            <svg class=\"btn-arrow\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n              <polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline>\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n          <button onclick=\"openPassportModal()\" class=\"btn-secondary\">\n            <span>🎒 Open Passport</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Scroll Indicator -->\n      <a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"hero-scroll-indicator\" aria-label=\"Scroll to explore destinations\">\n        <div class=\"scroll-mouse\">\n          <div class=\"scroll-wheel\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span>Scroll to Explore & Unlock</span>\n      </a>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================================================\n         EDITORIAL STATS STRIP (ANIMATED NUMBER COUNTERS)\n         ========================================================================== -->\n    <section class=\"stats-strip\" aria-label=\"Jharkhand Key Highlights\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n          <div class=\"stat-item fade-up\">\n            <span class=\"stat-number\" data-target=\"29\" data-suffix=\"%+\">0%+</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Forest Canopy</span>\n            <p class=\"stat-desc\">One of India's richest biodiversity hotspots crowned in Sal and Mahua.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item fade-up delay-1\">\n            <span class=\"stat-number\" data-target=\"143\" data-suffix=\"m\">0m</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Highest Cascade</span>\n            <p class=\"stat-desc\">Lodh Falls, tumbling thunderously in pristine Latehar wilderness.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item fade-up delay-2\">\n            <span class=\"stat-number\" data-target=\"1365\" data-suffix=\"m\">0m</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Highest Mountain</span>\n            <p class=\"stat-desc\">Parasnath Summit (Shikharji), supreme sacred Jain pilgrimage.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item fade-up delay-3\">\n            <span class=\"stat-number\" data-target=\"32\" data-suffix=\"\">0</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Tribal Communities</span>\n            <p class=\"stat-desc\">Living centuries of organic forest wisdom, music, and earth-pigment art.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================================================\n         FAMOUS DESTINATIONS SECTION (WITH TOURIST UNLOCK ENGINE)\n         ========================================================================== -->\n    <section id=\"famous-destinations\" class=\"destinations-section section-padding\" aria-label=\"Famous Destinations\">\n      <div class=\"watermark-bg\">JHARKHAND</div>\n\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-header flex-between\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"eyebrow\">Iconic Wonders • Unlock As You Explore</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-heading\">FAMOUS DESTINATIONS</h2>\n            <p class=\"section-subheading\">\"Hover or click places to collect official stamps into your Explorer Passport.\"</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Category Filter Bar -->\n          <div class=\"filter-bar\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0; border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0;\">\n            <button class=\"filter-chip active\" data-category=\"all\">All Places</button>\n            <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-category=\"waterfall\">Waterfalls</button>\n            <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-category=\"wildlife\">Wildlife & Nature</button>\n            <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-category=\"mountain\">Mountain Peaks</button>\n            <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-category=\"spiritual\">Spiritual & Heritage</button>\n            <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-category=\"scenic\">Scenic & Lakes</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dynamic Destination Cards Grid (Famous) -->\n        <div id=\"famous-destinations-grid\" class=\"destinations-grid\">\n          <!-- Populated by app.js -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================================================\n         \"DID YOU KNOW?\" EDITORIAL BREAK (INTERACTIVE MOMENT)\n         ========================================================================== -->\n    <section class=\"editorial-break\" aria-label=\"Did You Know Trivia\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-header text-center\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Discovery Notes</span>\n          <h2 class=\"section-heading\" style=\"font-size: 2.25rem;\">DID YOU KNOW?</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-subheading\">Fascinating historical, geological and cultural moments of the plateau.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"facts-container\" class=\"fact-carousel-container\">\n          <!-- Populated by app.js -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================================================\n         INTERACTIVE MAP SECTION\n         ========================================================================== -->\n    <section id=\"map-section\" class=\"map-section section-padding\" aria-label=\"Interactive Map of Jharkhand\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-header flex-between\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"eyebrow\">Cartographic Journey</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-heading\">EXPLORE THE MAP</h2>\n            <p class=\"section-subheading\">\"Click any pin to inspect the authentic place, collect its stamp, and zoom into coordinates.\"</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <button class=\"map-reset-btn\" onclick=\"resetJharkhandMapView()\" aria-label=\"Reset Map to State View\">\n            <span>⟲ Reset State Overview</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Map Container Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"map-wrapper\">\n          <!-- Filter Chips overlayed on Map -->\n          <div class=\"map-controls-bar\">\n            <button class=\"map-filter-btn active\" data-filter=\"all\">All Places</button>\n            <button class=\"map-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"waterfalls\">Waterfalls</button>\n            <button class=\"map-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"wildlife\">Forests & Wildlife</button>\n            <button class=\"map-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"spiritual\">Spiritual & Shrines</button>\n            <button class=\"map-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"scenic\">Scenic & Lakes</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Leaflet Map Element -->\n          <div id=\"jharkhand-map\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Jharkhand Destinations Map\"></div>\n\n          <!-- Legend Overlay -->\n          <div class=\"map-legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-item\">\n              <span class=\"legend-dot\"></span>\n              <span>Famous Destination</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================================================\n         TRAVEL THEMES & CURATED STORIES\n         ========================================================================== -->\n    <section id=\"travel-themes\" class=\"section-padding\" aria-label=\"Travel Themes and Experiences\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-header text-center\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Curated Collections</span>\n          <h2 class=\"section-heading\">EXPERIENCES CRAFTED BY NATURE</h2>\n          <p class=\"section-subheading\">From thunderous roaring cascades to serene ancient spiritual sanctums, find what calls you.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"themes-grid\" class=\"themes-grid\">\n          <!-- Populated by app.js -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================================================\n       MAD FEATURE: DIGITAL EXPLORER PASSPORT MODAL\n       ========================================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"passport-modal-backdrop\" class=\"passport-modal-backdrop\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"passport-user-rank\">\n    <div class=\"passport-book\">\n      <!-- Header with Rank and Emblem -->\n      <div class=\"passport-header-row\">\n        <div class=\"passport-title-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"passport-emblem\">🏆</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"passport-rank-badge\">Official Tourist Explorer Passport</div>\n            <h3 id=\"passport-user-rank\" class=\"passport-user-rank\">Novice Tourist</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"passport-progress-summary\">\n          <span id=\"passport-level-pill\" class=\"passport-level-pill\">0/12 Unlocked (0 XP)</span>\n          <button class=\"modal-close-btn\" style=\"position: static;\" onclick=\"closePassportModal()\" aria-label=\"Close passport\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Stamp Slots Grid (12 Total) -->\n      <div id=\"passport-stamps-grid\" class=\"passport-stamps-grid\">\n        <!-- Injected dynamically by app.js -->\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Passport Actions Footer -->\n      <div class=\"passport-footer-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn-secondary\" style=\"font-size: 0.75rem;\" onclick=\"unlockAllPlacesDemo()\">\n          <span>✨ Unlock All Stamps (Demo Mode)</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"btn-primary\" onclick=\"closePassportModal()\">\n          <span>Continue Exploring</span>\n          <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n            <polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================================================\n       FULL-SCREEN IMMERSIVE DESTINATION DETAILS MODAL\n       ========================================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"destination-modal-backdrop\" class=\"modal-backdrop\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"modal-title-heading\">\n    <div class=\"destination-modal\">\n      <button class=\"modal-close-btn\" onclick=\"closeDestinationModal()\" aria-label=\"Close details modal\">\n        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n\n      <!-- Dynamic Content Injected by openDestinationModal() in app.js -->\n      <div id=\"destination-modal-content\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================================================\n       EDITORIAL FOOTER\n       ========================================================================== -->\n  <footer id=\"about-footer\" class=\"footer\" aria-label=\"Footer\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n        <!-- Brand Narrative -->\n        <div>\n          <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"brand-logo\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">\n            <div class=\"brand-symbol\">J</div>\n            <span class=\"brand-text\">Jharkhand<span>.</span></span>\n          </a>\n          <p class=\"footer-tagline\">\"Explore beyond the ordinary.\"</p>\n          <p class=\"footer-brand-desc\">\n            A state of primeval Sal forests, roaring stepped cascades, sacred mountain sanctums, and vibrant indigenous art traditions.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Quick Links -->\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"footer-col-title\">Famous Places</h4>\n          <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n            <li><a href=\"#hero\" class=\"footer-link\">Home</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#famous-destinations\" class=\"footer-link\">Famous Destinations</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"footer-link\">Interactive Map</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#travel-themes\" class=\"footer-link\">Curated Themes</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Regions & Districts -->\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"footer-col-title\">Districts</h4>\n          <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n            <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"footer-link\">Ranchi (Capital)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"footer-link\">Latehar & Netarhat</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"footer-link\">Giridih (Parasnath)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"footer-link\">Deoghar (Sanctum)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#map-section\" class=\"footer-link\">Dhanbad & Maithon</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tourist Information & Helpline -->\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"footer-col-title\">Visitor Helpline</h4>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n            Jharkhand Tourism Development Corporation (JTDC)\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--gold-light); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">\n            Toll-Free: 1800-345-6571\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">\n            Tourist Information Centre, Birsa Munda Airport & Ranchi Railway Station.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n        <p>&copy; 2026 Jharkhand Tourism. All rights reserved.</p>\n        <p class=\"made-for-explorers\">\"Made for explorers.\"</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- Leaflet Map JS -->\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\" integrity=\"sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=\" crossorigin=\"\"></script>\n\n  <!-- Application Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"js/data.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/map.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Update index.html with authentic images, Explorer Passport modal, confetti canvas, and removed nature audio","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Bhavish Sawant\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\jharkhand-tourism\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating index.html","toolSummary":"Updating index.html"}}]}
