{"step_index":142,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:40:59Z","content":"Here are the updates with **authentic pictures of every famous place** and a **MAD Gamified Tourist Explorer Passport Unlock Experience**!\n\n---\n\n### 📸 1. Authentic Pictures of All Famous Places\nAll placeholder images have been replaced with real, verified high-resolution photographs directly from Wikimedia Commons:\n- 🌊 **Hundru Falls** (Ranchi) — The 98-meter plunge onto sculpted basalt rocks\n- 🛣️ **Patratu Valley & Dam** (Ramgarh) — Authentic winding 30 hairpin ribbon roads & reservoir\n- 🛕 **Baba Baidyanath Dham** (Deoghar) — Real view of the 72-foot stone spire and Panchasula\n- ⛰️ **Parasnath Hill (Shikharji)** (Giridih) — Actual panoramic vista of Anantnatha Tonk across the mountain ridge\n- 🐅 **Betla National Park** (Latehar) — Authentic Sal forest canopy & entrance gate\n- 💦 **Dassam Falls** (Ranchi) — Genuine Kanchi river cascade dropping 44 meters\n- 🧘 **Jonha Falls (Gautamdhara)** (Ranchi) — Real hanging valley waterfall\n- 🌲 **Netarhat** (Latehar) — Queen of Chotanagpur pine plantations and morning mist\n- ⚡ **Lodh Falls (Burha Ghaag)** (Latehar) — Real multi-tiered 143-meter giant\n- 🐘 **Dalma Wildlife Sanctuary** (East Singhbhum) — Authentic hilltop elephant lookout\n- 📜 **Tagore Hill** (Ranchi) — Shanti Dham stone pavilion atop the granite hill\n- ⛵ **Maithon Dam & Lake** (Dhanbad) — Real blue reservoir and green islands\n\n---\n\n### 🎒 2. The MAD \"Tourist Explorer Passport\" Unlock Experience\nThe website now turns every visitor into an active explorer:\n\n1. **Live Unlock System**:\n   - As tourists browse the website, **hovering on a card for 1.2 seconds**, **clicking \"Explore Details\"**, or **clicking a map pin** stamps that destination into their passport!\n2. **MAD Celebration Animations**:\n   - **Canvas Confetti & Gold Sparkle Shower**: A celebratory particle burst drops from the top of the screen on every unlock.\n   - **Unlock Toast Notification**: *\"Passport Stamp Collected: [Place Name]! +150 XP\"*.\n   - **Card Transformation**: The card dynamically upgrades with a glowing gold/emerald badge: `🏆 Stamp Collected`.\n3. **Digital Leather & Gold Explorer Passport Book**:\n   - Click the **\"🎒 Passport (0/12)\"** button in the navbar to open your digital passport book.\n   - Collect all **12 Official Destination Stamps**.\n   - Level up your Traveler Rank: **Novice Tourist** $\\to$ **Forest Wanderer** $\\to$ **Plateau Trailblazer** $\\to$ **Grand Master of Jharkhand 👑**.\n   - Features a **\"✨ Unlock All Stamps (Demo Mode)\"** button to test the complete 12/12 celebration instantly!\n\n---\n\n### 🔇 3. Nature Sound Section\n- The nature audio section and toggle button have been removed.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Experience It Right Now\n\nYour local development server is running in the background:\n\n👉 **[http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)**"}
