{"step_index":146,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:53:06Z","thinking":"**Envisioning The Gateway**\n\nI'm now diving into the \"locked state\" of the cinematic expedition gateway, the `#expedition-vault-gateway`. I'm picturing a dark, cosmic forest overlay initially, which will set the tone. At the center of this will be something to capture attention. I'm focusing on that, now.\n\n\n**Designing The Unveiling**\n\nNow I'm envisioning the gateway's unlocked state, triggered by that interactive seal. The unlock animation is becoming quite spectacular. Specifically, I'm imagining a violent pulse and gold flash, followed by light beams. The gateway doors will split open, with a dramatic iris warp, revealing a golden sparkle and confetti shockwave across the screen. This whole display will be a welcome to explorers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   JHARKHAND TOURISM - PREMIUM EDITORIAL DESIGN SYSTEM\n   Visual Identity: Deep Forest Green, Warm Sand, Muted Gold, Charcoal\n   Features: 5 Famous Destinations, Crazy Cinematic Vault Unlock, Passport\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   CSS VARIABLES & DESIGN TOKENS\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n:root {\n  --bg-prime: #061A13;            /* Deep Forest Night */\n  --bg-surface: #0B241B;          /* Deep Emerald Surface */\n  --bg-card: #0E2C22;             /* Forest Slate */\n  --bg-card-hover: #12372A;       /* Elevated Forest Surface */\n  --bg-light: #FBF9F5;            /* Editorial Warm Off-White */\n  --bg-light-surface: #F3EFEA;    /* Sand Off-White */\n  --bg-light-card: #FFFFFF;\n  \n  /* Text Colors */\n  --text-pure: #FFFFFF;\n  --text-main: #EDE8DE;           /* Soft Ivory */\n  --text-muted: #A3B8B0;          /* Muted Sage */\n  --text-dark: #141A17;           /* Charcoal Dark */\n  --text-dark-muted: #5E6964;     /* Medium Dark Slate */\n  \n  /* Luxury Accents */\n  --gold-prime: #C5A059;          /* Muted Champagne Gold */\n  --gold-light: #DFC27D;          /* Soft Radiant Gold */\n  --gold-dim: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);\n  --gold-glow: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35);\n  --emerald-accent: #10B981;\n  --emerald-glow: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);\n  --terracotta: #8D5B4C;\n  --warning-amber: #F59E0B;\n  --warning-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);\n  --warning-border: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);\n  --precaution-green: #2DD4BF;\n  --precaution-bg: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.08);\n  --precaution-border: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.35);\n\n  /* Glassmorphism & Borders */\n  --glass-bg: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.75);\n  --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  --glass-border-gold: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);\n  --glass-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n  --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n\n  /* Transitions & Easings */\n  --ease-luxury: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n  --ease-spring: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n  --ease-smooth: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  --transition-fast: 0.25s var(--ease-luxury);\n  --transition-normal: 0.5s var(--ease-luxury);\n  --transition-slow: 0.8s var(--ease-luxury);\n  --transition-kenburns: 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n\n  /* Layout */\n  --container-max: 1340px;\n  --nav-height: 86px;\n  --radius-sm: 6px;\n  --radius-md: 14px;\n  --radius-lg: 20px;\n  --radius-full: 9999px;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   GLOBAL RESET & BASE STYLES\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-prime);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\nbody {\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  background-color: var(--bg-prime);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n/* Selection */\n::selection {\n  background-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: var(--bg-prime);\n}\n\n/* Custom Scrollbar */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: var(--bg-prime);\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: #1A3D30;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n/* Top Scroll Reading Progress Indicator */\n.scroll-progress-indicator {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  width: 0%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #C5A059, #DFC27D, #10B981);\n  z-index: 10000;\n  transition: width 0.1s ease-out;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.8);\n}\n\n/* Fullscreen Canvas Confetti Particle System */\n#unlock-confetti-canvas {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 999999;\n}\n\n/* Focus Outlines */\n:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  outline-offset: 4px;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  display: block;\n}\n\na {\n  color: inherit;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  color: inherit;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   TYPOGRAPHY\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\nh1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6,\n.font-serif {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.eyebrow::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.section-heading {\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.section-subheading {\n  font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  max-width: 600px;\n}\n\n/* Atmospheric Background Typography Watermark */\n.watermark-bg {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 14rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   LAYOUT UTILITIES\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.container {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: var(--container-max);\n  margin-left: auto;\n  margin-right: auto;\n  padding-left: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);\n  padding-right: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.section-padding {\n  padding-top: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);\n  padding-bottom: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);\n}\n\n.section-header {\n  margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);\n}\n\n.section-header.text-center {\n  text-align: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.section-header.text-center .eyebrow::after {\n  content: '';\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.flex-between {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   MAD FEATURE: CRAZY CINEMATIC EXPEDITION UNLOCK PORTAL GATEWAY\n   ========================================================================== */\n.expedition-vault-gateway {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 999999;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #0B2B20 0%, #040F0B 80%, #010604 100%);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: opacity 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), clip-path 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1);\n  clip-path: circle(150% at 50% 50%);\n}\n\n.expedition-vault-gateway.unlocked {\n  clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n/* Cosmic Ring Lasers & Portal Background */\n.gateway-portal-rings {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n  width: 600px;\n  height: 600px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.portal-ring {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 1px dashed rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25);\n  animation: portal-spin 20s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.portal-ring:nth-child(2) {\n  inset: 50px;\n  border: 1.5px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);\n  animation: portal-spin-reverse 15s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.portal-ring:nth-child(3) {\n  inset: 100px;\n  border: 1px dashed rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);\n  animation: portal-spin 10s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes portal-spin {\n  0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n\n@keyframes portal-spin-reverse {\n  0% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n  100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n}\n\n.gateway-center-vault {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 10;\n  text-align: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  max-width: 600px;\n}\n\n.vault-seal-btn {\n  width: 140px;\n  height: 140px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #DFC27D 0%, #C5A059 50%, #8A6828 100%);\n  border: 3px solid #FFFFFF;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.8), 0 0 100px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n  position: relative;\n  animation: seal-breathe 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes seal-breathe {\n  0%, 100% {\n    transform: scale(1);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.7), 0 0 80px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: scale(1.08);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 70px rgba(197, 160, 89, 1), 0 0 120px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6);\n  }\n}\n\n.vault-seal-btn:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.15) rotate(10deg);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 90px rgba(197, 160, 89, 1), 0 0 140px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.8);\n}\n\n.vault-seal-icon {\n  font-size: 3rem;\n  color: #061A13;\n  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));\n}\n\n.vault-seal-text {\n  font-size: 0.68rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: #061A13;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.vault-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.vault-title span {\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.vault-subtitle {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  max-width: 480px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.vault-hint {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-light);\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  padding: 0.4rem 1rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.1);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   STICKY NAVIGATION BAR\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.navbar {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  z-index: 1000;\n  padding: 1.5rem 0;\n  transition: padding var(--transition-normal), background var(--transition-normal), border var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.navbar.scrolled {\n  padding: 0.9rem 0;\n  background: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.88);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: transform var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.brand-logo:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n\n.brand-symbol {\n  width: 34px;\n  height: 34px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25);\n}\n\n.brand-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.brand-text span {\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 2.25rem;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  position: relative;\n  padding: 0.4rem 0;\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.nav-link::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 1.5px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  transition: width var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover,\n.nav-link.active {\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover::after,\n.nav-link.active::after {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.nav-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   MAD FEATURE: EXPLORER PASSPORT BADGE (NAVBAR & FLOATING)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.passport-nav-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.65rem;\n  padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  border: 1px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1));\n  color: var(--gold-light);\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);\n}\n\n.passport-nav-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: #061A13;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.45);\n}\n\n.passport-badge-count {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: #061A13;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n}\n\n.passport-nav-btn:hover .passport-badge-count {\n  background: #061A13;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n/* Floating Unlock Notification Toast */\n.unlock-toast {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 100px;\n  right: 2rem;\n  z-index: 100000;\n  background: rgba(7, 31, 23, 0.95);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 25px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);\n  transform: translateX(120%);\n  transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-spring), opacity 0.6s;\n  pointer-events: auto;\n  max-width: 420px;\n}\n\n.unlock-toast.show {\n  transform: translateX(0);\n}\n\n.unlock-toast-icon {\n  font-size: 2.25rem;\n  animation: stamp-drop 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n@keyframes stamp-drop {\n  0% { transform: scale(3) rotate(-25deg); opacity: 0; }\n  100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n.unlock-toast-title {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.unlock-toast-place {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.unlock-toast-xp {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: #34D399;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* Primary CTA Button */\n.btn-primary {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: #061A13;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -5px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35);\n}\n\n.btn-primary::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: -100%;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35), transparent);\n  transition: left 0.6s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  background: var(--gold-light);\n  border-color: var(--gold-light);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -5px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.5);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover::before {\n  left: 100%;\n}\n\n.btn-primary .btn-arrow {\n  transition: transform var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {\n  transform: translateX(5px);\n}\n\n/* Secondary Button / Outline */\n.btn-secondary {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n/* Mobile Hamburger Toggle */\n.mobile-nav-toggle {\n  display: none;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 44px;\n  padding: 8px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n  z-index: 1001;\n}\n\n.mobile-nav-toggle span {\n  display: block;\n  height: 2px;\n  width: 100%;\n  background: var(--text-pure);\n  border-radius: 1px;\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.mobile-nav-toggle.open span:nth-child(1) {\n  transform: translateY(8px) rotate(45deg);\n}\n.mobile-nav-toggle.open span:nth-child(2) {\n  opacity: 0;\n}\n.mobile-nav-toggle.open span:nth-child(3) {\n  transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(-45deg);\n}\n\n/* Mobile Navigation Drawer */\n.mobile-drawer {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.98);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n  z-index: 999;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 3rem 2rem;\n  transform: translateX(100%);\n  transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-luxury);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.mobile-drawer.open {\n  transform: translateX(0);\n  pointer-events: auto;\n}\n\n.mobile-drawer-links {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 1.75rem;\n  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.mobile-drawer-link {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.mobile-drawer-link:hover,\n.mobile-drawer-link.active {\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   HERO SECTION (CINEMATIC FULLSCREEN)\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.hero {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  text-align: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  padding: 8rem 1.5rem 5rem;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-container {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: center;\n  animation: var(--transition-kenburns);\n  transform-origin: center center;\n  filter: brightness(0.85);\n  will-change: transform;\n}\n\n.hero-orb {\n  position: absolute;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  filter: blur(80px);\n  opacity: 0.35;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-orb-1 {\n  top: 15%;\n  left: 20%;\n  width: 320px;\n  height: 320px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, #C5A059, transparent 70%);\n  animation: float-orb 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n\n.hero-orb-2 {\n  bottom: 20%;\n  right: 15%;\n  width: 400px;\n  height: 400px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, #10B981, transparent 70%);\n  animation: float-orb 16s ease-in-out infinite 2s alternate-reverse;\n}\n\n@keyframes float-orb {\n  0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\n  100% { transform: translate(40px, -30px) scale(1.15); }\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.45) 0%, rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.85) 85%),\n              linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.5) 0%, transparent 40%, rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.95) 100%);\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n@keyframes kenburns {\n  0% {\n    transform: scale(1) translate(0, 0);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: scale(1.08) translate(-1%, -1%);\n  }\n  100% {\n    transform: scale(1.14) translate(1%, 0.5%);\n  }\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  max-width: 920px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.hero-tag {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1.2vw, 0.95rem);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.35em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.hero-tag::before,\n.hero-tag::after {\n  content: '';\n  width: 30px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6.5vw, 5.5rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  text-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n}\n\n.hero-title span {\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #F8F5EE;\n}\n\n.hero-subtitle {\n  font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.45rem);\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: var(--gold-light);\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-style: italic;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n\n.hero-description {\n  font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.2vw, 1.125rem);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  max-width: 640px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.hero-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  margin-top: 1.25rem;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.hero-scroll-indicator {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 2rem;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6rem;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.25em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.hero-scroll-indicator:hover {\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(3px);\n}\n\n.scroll-mouse {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding-top: 6px;\n}\n\n.scroll-wheel {\n  width: 3px;\n  height: 6px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  animation: scroll-bob 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes scroll-bob {\n  0% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }\n  60% { transform: translateY(8px); opacity: 0; }\n  61% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0; }\n  100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   EDITORIAL STATS STRIP / ANIMATED STATS COUNTER\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.stats-strip {\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  background: rgba(11, 36, 27, 0.4);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n  padding: 2.5rem 0;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 2rem;\n}\n\n.stat-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.35rem;\n  border-left: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25);\n  padding-left: 1.5rem;\n  transition: transform var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.stat-item:hover {\n  transform: translateX(4px);\n}\n\n.stat-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--gold-light);\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n}\n\n.stat-desc {\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   TOP 5 DESTINATIONS GRID & EDITORIAL CARDS\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.destinations-section {\n  position: relative;\n  background-color: var(--bg-prime);\n}\n\n.filter-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  margin-bottom: 3rem;\n  padding-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.filter-chip {\n  padding: 0.65rem 1.35rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  transition: all 0.35s var(--ease-luxury);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.filter-chip:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.filter-chip.active {\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: #061A13;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);\n}\n\n/* Cards Grid for Top 5 Places */\n.destinations-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));\n  gap: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   DESTINATION CARD (CINEMATIC 3D TILT HOVER & HOVER MECHANICS)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.destination-card {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 520px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n  transition: border-color 0.6s var(--ease-luxury), box-shadow 0.6s var(--ease-luxury), transform 0.6s var(--ease-luxury);\n  will-change: transform, box-shadow;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  transform-style: preserve-3d;\n}\n\n.destination-card::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -50%;\n  left: -50%;\n  width: 200%;\n  height: 200%;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    45deg,\n    transparent 40%,\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12) 50%,\n    transparent 60%\n  );\n  transform: rotate(-45deg) translateY(-100%);\n  transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 4;\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover::after {\n  transform: rotate(-45deg) translateY(100%);\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.5);\n  box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75), 0 0 25px -5px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);\n  transform: translateY(-6px);\n}\n\n.destination-card.is-unlocked {\n  border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);\n  box-shadow: 0 15px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 20px -5px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);\n}\n\n.card-media {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.card-img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: center;\n  transform: scale(1);\n  transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), filter 0.8s ease;\n  will-change: transform;\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover .card-img {\n  transform: scale(1.08) translate3d(-1%, -1%, 0);\n  filter: contrast(1.05);\n}\n\n.card-gradient {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.15) 0%,\n    rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.4) 40%,\n    rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.85) 75%,\n    rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.98) 100%\n  );\n  transition: background 0.6s var(--ease-luxury);\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover .card-gradient {\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.25) 0%,\n    rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.55) 35%,\n    rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.92) 70%,\n    rgba(4, 15, 11, 1) 100%\n  );\n}\n\n.card-top-meta {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 1.5rem;\n  left: 1.5rem;\n  right: 1.5rem;\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.badge-famous {\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);\n  color: var(--gold-light);\n}\n\n.badge-unlocked {\n  background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25) !important;\n  border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6) !important;\n  color: #34D399 !important;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.card-district {\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n.card-body {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  padding: 1.75rem;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n  transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover .card-body {\n  transform: translateY(-6px);\n}\n\n.card-category {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n  transition: opacity 0.4s var(--ease-luxury), transform 0.4s var(--ease-luxury);\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover .card-category {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.card-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.65rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.card-tagline {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  display: -webkit-box;\n  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.card-cta-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-top: 0.75rem;\n  padding-top: 0.85rem;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n.card-explore-btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-light);\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.card-explore-btn svg {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-luxury);\n}\n\n.destination-card:hover .card-explore-btn svg {\n  transform: translateX(5px);\n}\n\n.card-map-action {\n  width: 34px;\n  height: 34px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.card-map-action:hover {\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: #061A13;\n  transform: scale(1.15) rotate(12deg);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   DESKTOP CUSTOM CURSOR FOLLOWER\n   ========================================================================== */\n.card-cursor-follower {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 72px;\n  height: 72px;\n  margin-left: -36px;\n  margin-top: -36px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.9);\n  color: #061A13;\n  font-size: 0.68rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 10000;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: scale(0.5);\n  transition: opacity 0.3s var(--ease-luxury), transform 0.3s var(--ease-luxury);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n}\n\n.card-cursor-follower.active {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   \"DID YOU KNOW?\" EDITORIAL MOMENTS & MYSTERY RELIC REVEAL\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.editorial-break {\n  position: relative;\n  background: #04120D;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  padding: 5rem 0;\n}\n\n.editorial-break::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n  width: 800px;\n  height: 300px;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.fact-carousel-container {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n  gap: 2rem;\n}\n\n.fact-card {\n  background: rgba(11, 36, 27, 0.4);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 2.25rem;\n  position: relative;\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.fact-card:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35);\n  background: rgba(11, 36, 27, 0.7);\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n}\n\n.fact-num {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 2.5rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.fact-tag {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.fact-headline {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n.fact-body {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   INTERACTIVE MAP SECTION\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.map-section {\n  position: relative;\n  background: #051610;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n}\n\n.map-wrapper {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 640px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);\n}\n\n#jharkhand-map {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: #081D15;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.map-controls-bar {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 1.25rem;\n  left: 1.25rem;\n  z-index: 10;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.map-filter-btn {\n  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  background: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.85);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.4rem;\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.map-filter-btn:hover,\n.map-filter-btn.active {\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: #061A13;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.map-reset-btn {\n  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  background: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.85);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.map-reset-btn:hover {\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  border-color: var(--text-pure);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.map-legend {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 1.25rem;\n  right: 1.25rem;\n  z-index: 10;\n  background: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.9);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.legend-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6rem;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.legend-dot {\n  width: 10px;\n  height: 10px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   TRAVEL EXPERIENCES & CURATED THEMES\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.themes-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1.75rem;\n}\n\n.theme-card {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 380px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  transition: all var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.theme-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  box-shadow: 0 25px 45px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 20px -5px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25);\n}\n\n.theme-bg {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.theme-img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  transition: transform 0.8s var(--ease-luxury);\n}\n\n.theme-card:hover .theme-img {\n  transform: scale(1.08);\n}\n\n.theme-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.95) 0%, rgba(4, 15, 11, 0.4) 60%, transparent 100%);\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.theme-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.theme-count {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.theme-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.theme-sub {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   MAD FEATURE: EXPLORER PASSPORT MODAL (5 STAMPS EDITION)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.passport-modal-backdrop {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 100000;\n  background: rgba(2, 8, 6, 0.92);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(30px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  opacity: 0;\n  visibility: hidden;\n  transition: opacity 0.5s var(--ease-luxury), visibility 0.5s;\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.passport-modal-backdrop.open {\n  opacity: 1;\n  visibility: visible;\n}\n\n.passport-book {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1060px;\n  max-height: 88vh;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #092017 0%, #05140F 100%);\n  border: 2px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 40px rgba(197, 160, 89,